<title>NORWAY: Kvaerner awards Aasgard B contract.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner awards Aasgard B contract.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-Norwegian construction and engineering group Kvaerner ASA said on Tuesday it had awarded a letter of intent to Emtunga AB of Gothenburg, Sweden worth around 170 million crowns.</p>
<p>The deal covers the engineering, procurement and construction of living quarters with helicopter deck for the Aasgard B platform in the Haltenbank off mid-Norway.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
